    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 13.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe ofer ðæt láde geþafie oððe se þe hy sylle, gilde VI healfmarc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who subsequently permits a man to clear himself [of a transaction], and [likewise] he who offers to clear himself shall pay 6 half-marks.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et qui super id ladam prorogat uel qui dat, reddat sex dimidiam marcam</ab>
      </div>
